					"content": "どうだ、撮ってきたか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大島純平"
				},
				{
					"id": 220450402,
					"content": "うん、撮ってきた。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220450403,
					"content": "どれどれ…おっ！この角度、この姿、悪くない！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450404,
						220450405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大島純平"
				},
				{
					"id": 220450404,
					"content": "気迫が凄い…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220450406,
					"content": "問題ない、これらの写真ならとてもいい参考になる。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大島純平"
				},
				{
					"id": 220450407,
					"content": "ありがとう、これを受け取ってくれ。俺は今から木彫りの練習を続ける。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220450408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大島純平"
				},
				{
					"id": 220450408,
					"content": "ふむ、実に良い…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "大島純平"
				},
				{
